  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed from the **nous** form of the present, dropping **-ons** and adding **-ant**: **nous parlons** → **parlant**, **nous finissons** → **finissant**.",
      "Irregular: **être** → **étant**, **avoir** → **ayant**, **faire** → **faisant**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Use",
     "texto": [
      "It is used with **en** in front: **en travaillant** (working, while I work). It says that two actions happen at the same time or how something is done: **Je travaille en écoutant de la musique** (I work listening to music)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
